{"seq":1,"slug":"prospect-theory-foundations","title":"前景理论基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/prospect-theory-and-decision/prospect-theory-foundations","wordCount":1989,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"前景理论基础\">前景理论基础</h1><p>1979 年 3 月，<em>Econometrica</em> 刊出一篇题为 &quot;Prospect Theory: An Analysis of Decision under Risk&quot; 的论文。作者卡尼曼与特沃斯基在开头写下一句温和却颠覆的话：期望效用理论作为描述性模型存在系统性缺陷。此后四十余年，这篇论文成为经济学史上被引用最多的文献之一，2002 年卡尼曼获诺贝尔经济学奖，授奖词直接以它为核心。它取代期望效用的方式不是推翻，而是给出一个更贴近实验事实的替代品——本篇拆解这个替代品的三个部件：编辑阶段、价值函数、权重函数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前景理论把&quot;人在风险下的决策&quot;拆成两阶段：先对选项做<strong>编辑</strong>（editing），再对编辑后的结果做<strong>评价</strong>（evaluation）。评价阶段由两个函数驱动——价值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 替代效用函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(w)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，权重函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 替代概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>。与期望效用的根本区别在于：效用以<strong>最终财富</strong>为自变量，价值以<strong>参照点的盈亏</strong>为自变量；概率直接线性进入期望值，权重则对概率做非线性变换。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[风险决策任务] --&gt; B[编辑阶段: 决策前的编码操作]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[编码: 相对参照点定盈亏]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[合并/分解: 化简结果组合]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[抵消: 删去共有成分]&#10;    B --&gt; B4[简化: 舍入粗粒化]&#10;    B1 --&gt; C[评价阶段]&#10;    B2 --&gt; C&#10;    B3 --&gt; C&#10;    B4 --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;价值函数 v(x): S形, 损失更陡&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;权重函数 w(p): 高估小概率, 低估中高概率&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[选择]&#10;    E --&gt; F\">graph TD\n    A[风险决策任务] --&gt; B[编辑阶段: 决策前的编码操作]\n    B --&gt; B1[编码: 相对参照点定盈亏]\n    B --&gt; B2[合并/分解: 化简结果组合]\n    B --&gt; B3[抵消: 删去共有成分]\n    B --&gt; B4[简化: 舍入粗粒化]\n    B1 --&gt; C[评价阶段]\n    B2 --&gt; C\n    B3 --&gt; C\n    B4 --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D[\"价值函数 v(x): S形, 损失更陡\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"权重函数 w(p): 高估小概率, 低估中高概率\"]\n    D --&gt; F[选择]\n    E --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"编辑阶段-决策前的编码操作\">编辑阶段：决策前的编码操作</h2><h3 id=\"一个常见的误解澄清\">一个常见的误解澄清</h3><p>编辑阶段是前景理论中最常被误解的部件——它指决策者<strong>在评价之前</strong>对结果集做的心理预处理，与公共政策里的&quot;助推&quot;毫无关系（助推是外部对选择环境的设计，见<a href=\"../behavioral-economics-applications/nudge-and-choice-architecture\">助推与选择架构</a>；编辑是决策者内部的信息加工）。TK 1979 列举了四种主要操作：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>编码</strong>（coding）：相对某个参照点把结果标记为收益或损失——参照点通常是现状，也可以是预期；</li>\n<li><strong>合并</strong>（combination）与<strong>分解</strong>（segregation）：把同结果的概率相加（75% 赚 200 加 25% 赚 200 即为 100% 赚 200），或把&quot;确定部分+赌局&quot;拆开处理；</li>\n<li><strong>抵消</strong>（cancellation）：两个前景共有的成分被忽略——这正是框架效应的来源，亚洲疾病问题里&quot;救 200 人/死 400 人&quot;的共有底数被表述差异凸显或掩盖；</li>\n<li><strong>简化</strong>（simplification）：对概率与金额做舍入粗化（99% 被当作确定，101 元被当作 100 元）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>编辑阶段解释了一个纯评价模型无法解释的现象：为什么同一个赌局换种说法就被重新编码。它是框架效应进入前景理论的接口，与本 hub <a href=\"../cognitive-biases/anchoring-and-framing\">锚定效应与框架效应</a>互为印证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"价值函数-s-形曲线的数学结构\">价值函数：S 形曲线的数学结构</h2><h3 id=\"三条经验规律推出一条曲线\">三条经验规律推出一条曲线</h3><p>价值函数的形状由三条经验规律推出：<strong>参照点依赖</strong>（人们关心盈亏而非最终财富）、<strong>敏感性递减</strong>（离参照点越远，边际心理价值越低）、<strong>损失厌恶</strong>（同量损失比收益更痛）。三者合起来给出一条过参照点的 S 形曲线：收益侧凹、损失侧凸、损失侧更陡。Tversky 与 Kahneman（1992, <em>Journal of Risk and Uncertainty</em>）用累积前景理论给出了参数估计：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>α</mi></msup></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>x</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>β</mi></msup></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(x) = \\begin{cases} x^{\\alpha} &amp; x \\geq 0 \\\\ -\\lambda(-x)^{\\beta} &amp; x &lt; 0 \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.88</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\approx \\beta \\approx 0.88</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.88</span></span></span></span></span>，损失厌恶系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\approx 2.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25</span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 编码敏感性递减；<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 编码&quot;损失更痛&quot;。注意 S 形曲线是<strong>价值函数的形状</strong>——它刻画的是单个决策者对盈亏的编码方式，而不是该理论&quot;在群体或社会层面的延伸&quot;；群体层面的现象另有机制（社会规范、信息层叠等，见第三章）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"权重函数-概率的非线性加权\">权重函数：概率的非线性加权</h2><p>前景理论的第二个部件处理概率。期望效用里概率线性加权；前景理论用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 替换，其形状是<strong>倒 S 形</strong>：小概率被高估（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(p) &gt; p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>，所以人们买彩票、买保险），中高概率被低估（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0.99</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0.99</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(0.99) &lt; 0.99</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0.99</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.99</span></span></span></span></span>，所以确定性溢价存在）。TK 1992 的估计中，收益侧参数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.61</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma \\approx 0.61</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.61</span></span></span></span></span>、损失侧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.69</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta \\approx 0.69</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.69</span></span></span></span></span>，常用函数形式为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msup><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>γ</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>γ</mi></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>γ</mi></mrow></msup></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(p) = \\frac{p^{\\gamma}}{\\left(p^{\\gamma} + (1-p)^{\\gamma}\\right)^{1/\\gamma}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5093em;vertical-align:-1.1679em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3414em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0279em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5904em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0279em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2579em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0279em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7049em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.0279em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1679em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>概率扭曲<strong>指的就是这个权重函数的非线性加权</strong>——它发生在个体对风险前景的评价环节，与社会比较、从众等群体现象无关。权重函数还满足次确定性：对中高概率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(p) + w(1-p) &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>，这直接复现了 Allais 悖论（1953）：多数人在&quot;确定得 3000&quot;与&quot;80% 得 4000&quot;之间选前者，却同时在&quot;25% 得 3000&quot;与&quot;20% 得 4000&quot;之间选后者——两组选择在期望效用下互相矛盾，在权重函数下自然自洽。</p>\n<p>把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.61</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma \\approx 0.61</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.61</span></span></span></span></span> 代入上式，可以直观看到权重的弯曲程度（数值按该参数计算）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>真实概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>1%</th>\n<th>10%</th>\n<th>50%</th>\n<th>90%</th>\n<th>99%</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>决策权重 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>约 6%</td>\n<td>约 18%</td>\n<td>约 42%</td>\n<td>约 71%</td>\n<td>约 91%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两端被拉伸、中段被压缩——1% 的灾难在心理上重如 6%，99% 的把握轻如 91%。彩票与保险的共存、确定性溢价、对&quot;几乎必然&quot;事件的麻痹，都是这条曲线的日常投影。</p>\n<p>1992 年的<strong>累积前景理论</strong>（CPT）还修补了原始版本的一个技术缺陷：原始理论对每个前景独立加权，可能违反随机占优；CPT 改为按结果排序后做累积加权（秩依赖），既保住了倒 S 形的经验拟合，又恢复了占优一致性。今天文献中的参数估计（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\approx 2.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25</span></span></span></span></span> 等）均出自 CPT 版本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"四重模式-风险态度的完整地图\">四重模式：风险态度的完整地图</h2><p>价值函数与权重函数合起来，预测出四种风险态度的组合，即<strong>四重模式</strong>（TK 1979 提出，TK 1992 定型）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>确定性（高概率）</th>\n<th>可能性（低概率）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>收益</strong></td>\n<td>风险规避：拿确定的 3000，不赌 80% 的 4000</td>\n<td>风险寻求：买彩票，高估 1% 的暴富机会</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>损失</strong></td>\n<td>风险寻求：宁可赌 80% 亏 4000，不接受确定亏 3000</td>\n<td>风险规避：买保险，高估 1% 的灾难概率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表是前景理论最有操作价值的一页：同一个投资者，面对盈利时急于落袋、面对亏损时死扛到底（处置效应），面对小概率事件时同时买彩票与买保险——四个看似矛盾的行为，其实是同一组参数在不同象限的投影。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与期望效用理论的对照\">与期望效用理论的对照</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>期望效用（vNM, 1944）</th>\n<th>前景理论（TK 1979/1992）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自变量</td>\n<td>最终财富水平</td>\n<td>相对参照点的盈亏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>概率处理</td>\n<td>线性加权</td>\n<td>非线性权重函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险态度</td>\n<td>全局单一（凸/凹效用）</td>\n<td>四重模式，随情境切换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>框架敏感性</td>\n<td>无（不变性公理）</td>\n<td>编辑阶段的抵消操作使其敏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>描述准确性</td>\n<td>系统性偏离实验</td>\n<td>与选择数据高度吻合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>期望效用并未被抛弃——它仍是规范性基准与公理化语言；前景理论的贡献是把&quot;人实际如何选&quot;描述清楚。两者是描述与规范的关系，不是简单的对错关系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>前景理论 = 编辑阶段（决策前编码操作）+ 价值函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（S 形、损失侧更陡）+ 权重函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w(p)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（倒 S、非线性加权）</li>\n<li>S 形曲线是价值函数的形状；概率扭曲是权重函数的非线性；两者都在个体评价环节，与群体现象无关</li>\n<li>编辑阶段的抵消操作是框架效应的理论接口；它与助推（外部环境设计）是两码事</li>\n<li>参数锚点：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.88</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha \\approx \\beta \\approx 0.88</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.88</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>2.25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda \\approx 2.25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.25</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.61</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma \\approx 0.61</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6776em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.61</span></span></span></span></span>（Tversky &amp; Kahneman, 1992）</li>\n<li>四重模式把&quot;买彩票又买保险&quot;&quot;落袋为安又死扛亏损&quot;统一进一张 2×2 表</li>\n<li>损失厌恶系数的实证与神经证据，见<a href=\"loss-aversion-and-risk-attitude\">损失厌恶与风险态度</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"前景理论基础","id":"前景理论基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"编辑阶段：决策前的编码操作","id":"编辑阶段-决策前的编码操作"},{"level":3,"text":"一个常见的误解澄清","id":"一个常见的误解澄清"},{"level":2,"text":"价值函数：S 形曲线的数学结构","id":"价值函数-s-形曲线的数学结构"},{"level":3,"text":"三条经验规律推出一条曲线","id":"三条经验规律推出一条曲线"},{"level":2,"text":"权重函数：概率的非线性加权","id":"权重函数-概率的非线性加权"},{"level":2,"text":"四重模式：风险态度的完整地图","id":"四重模式-风险态度的完整地图"},{"level":2,"text":"与期望效用理论的对照","id":"与期望效用理论的对照"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"现状偏差与禀赋效应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/cognitive-biases/status-quo-and-endowment-effect"},"next":{"title":"损失厌恶与风险态度","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/behavioral-economics/prospect-theory-and-decision/loss-aversion-and-risk-attitude"}}